  "describe": "Top: a world in plate carrée at 10:30 on 31 October: the night side shaded with a soft edge, the sun over southern Africa, London lit (warm dot with a halo), New York, Tokyo and Sydney at night (red dots); bottom: Europe with borders, France and Germany in the primary colour and a marker on Paris (lon/lat host variables). evening (19:45): the day over the Americas, New York lit, London dark. Mono: the night edge as a line, the sun a disc in a ring, lit cities filled and the others hollow.",
